graph TB
    Input[Input: CCI Analysis Results] --> Planning
    
    subgraph DeepAgent["🤖 Deep Agent Architecture"]
        Planning[📋 Planning Layer<br/>write_todos]
        
        Planning --> MainAgent{Orchestrator<br/>Agent}

        MainAgent <-->|progressive disclosure| Memory[💾 Skiils]    
        Memory -.-> MainAgent
        MainAgent -->|Thought-Action-Observation| Tools[🛠️ Tools<br/>MCP servers]
        Tools -.-> MainAgent
        

        MainAgent -->|task tool| Subagents[👥 Subagents<br/>Specialized Workers]
        Subagents -.->|Results| MainAgent
        
        MainAgent <-->|read/write| FileSystem[(📁 File System<br/>Context Management)]
    
    end
    
    MainAgent --> Output[Output: Final Result]
    
    subgraph Example["💡 Biological Interpreter 예시"]
        Ex_Tools[Tools:<br/>• PubMed download<br/>• RAG upload]
        Ex_Subagents[Subagents:<br/>• Pathway interpreter<br/>• CCI interpreter<br/>• Process interpreter]
        Ex_FileSystem[File System:<br/>• Downloaded papers<br/>• RAG vector store]
        Ex_Memory[Memory:<br/>• Previous interpretations<br/>• Reference database]
        Ex_Output[Output:<br/>• Cited interpretation<br/>• Low hallucination]
    end
    
    style Planning fill:#fff4e6
    style MainAgent fill:#e3f2fd
    style Tools fill:#ffe0b2
    style Subagents fill:#f3e5f5
    style FileSystem fill:#e8f5e9
    style Memory fill:#e1f5fe
    style Output fill:#c8e6c9
    style DeepAgent fill:#fafafa,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Example fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#666,stroke-dasharray: 5 5